// expect: 134 trap: a precondition failed at tests/micros/mn-div-open-says:8:13 — the divisor is 0
// An integer division whose divisor the fragment cannot prove nonzero
// checks its claim where the instruction would trap and stops saying so,
// at the operator's own address and naming the face that failed; the
// engine's own trap said `integer divide by zero` and no address.
fn zero_from(n) = n - n

fn main() = 7 / zero_from(3)
